            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A mobile communication system is described which is configured to use a carrier aggregation aggregating a plurality of subcarriers to carry out radio communication between a mobile terminal and a base station, wherein the mobile terminal is configured to report the base station measurement results of reception quality using CQI when data is transmitted and received using one subcarrier among the plurality of subcarriers, wherein the mobile terminal is configured to not report the base station the measurement results of the reception quality using CQI when data is not transmitted and received using the one subcarrier.</p>
            </abstract>
